# LIQUID-04 — Use render instead of deprecated include

## Rationale

`{% render %}` has isolated scope; deprecated `{% include %}` leaks scope and is
harder to reason about.

## How to check

```bash
bun "<skill-dir>/scripts/cli.ts" check liquid-performance <file>
```

Flags `{% include %}`.

## How to fix

Replace `{% include 'x' %}` with `{% render 'x' %}`, passing needed variables
explicitly. If the snippet relied on implicit outer-scope variables, pass them as
render arguments (downgrade to propose if scope is unclear).

## Examples

### Bad

```liquid
{% include 'card' %}
```

### Good

```liquid
{% render 'card', title: product.title, url: product.url %}
```
